{"ID":"20240118151106-9ldxdlr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151106-9ldxdlr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151106-9ldxdlr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151106-0td963m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240201174411-8ibf9vz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151106-0td963m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:96\u0026#125;","title":"224牛角鳃","type":"doc","updated":"20240201174534"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151106-0td963m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151106-0td963m","updated":"20240122135732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】牛黄味苦，平，有小毒。治惊痫，寒热，热盛，狂，痉，除邪，逐鬼。生平泽。牛角鳃，温，无毒。下闭血，瘀血疼痛，女人带下血。髓，补中，填骨髓，久服增年。胆，治惊，寒热，可丸药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135735-b4p1lwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135735-b4p1lwk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】牛黄生于病牛胆中，状如鸡子黄，多出陕西甘肃等地。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135736-q1lma17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135736-q1lma17"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦（或作甘），性平（或作凉），有小毒（或作无毒）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135738-0jjxlga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135738-0jjxlga"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】牛黄为泻热定惊，利痰清心要药，主惊痫，寒热中恶，口噤，小儿惊邪，痘疮发狂，治痰迷，径急，斑痧，疮毒，益肝胆，定魂魄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135741-pb4t5vp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135741-pb4t5vp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗小儿百病，诸痫热，口不开，大人狂癫，又堕胎，久服令人不忘。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135742-llh3fwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135742-llh3fwn","updated":"20240122135746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】安魂定魄，辟邪魅，卒中恶，小儿夜啼。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135748-jd5vraa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135748-jd5vraa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】主中风失音，口噤，惊悸，天行时疾，健忘虚乏。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135750-g8w39xl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135750-g8w39xl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【思邈】益肝胆，定惊神，除热止惊痢，辟恶气，除百病。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135751-qkccl9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135751-qkccl9h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135752-rt41f8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135752-rt41f8b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】恶龙骨龙胆，地黄常山蜚蠊，畏牛膝干漆，风热未深入者忌用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135753-t34cxes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135753-t34cxes"}},{"ID":"20240122135754-8w8idmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135754-8w8idmr"}},{"ID":"20240122135754-5bd67hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135754-5bd67hn","updated":"20240201174534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"224牛角，我们前面介绍过牛黄，这个牛角，牛髓，牛胆都在这个地方出现，这个牛黄我们前面介绍过了，大家可以回头年看，第115味药就是牛黄，用在小儿科，治小儿沙疹，豆疹，小儿科的热症，小孩子受惊都可以使用牛黄。过去的牛黄清心丸就在这里。牛黄为泄热。那牛髓呢，骨髓呢补中，填骨髓，所以如果你说要补钙质补骨头，补脑，买那牛骨头来熬汤吃，熬汤最好，那吃素的你可以用些豆类的来取代。"}]},{"ID":"20240201174411-8ibf9vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201174411-8ibf9vz"}}]}